Anonymized dataset release for peer review
==========================================

The CoreFrac dataset accompanies a paper currently under double-blind review.
All site, well, operator, and depth metadata have been removed, and drill-core
identifiers have been anonymized (core_0001 … core_0200). Image and mask files
were re-encoded to strip EXIF / embedded metadata.

For the review period, this dataset is provided solely for the purpose of
evaluating the submission. Redistribution outside of the review process is not
permitted.

Upon acceptance, the dataset will be released under a permissive data license
(CC BY 4.0) with full attribution.
